AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000064> "adapted from discussion on OBI list (Matthew Pocock, Christian Cocos, Alan Ruttenberg)"@en)
