AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200167> "Quantile transformation which has normalization objective can be used for expression microarray assay normalization and it is referred to as \"quantile normalization\", according to the procedure described e.g. in PMID 12538238."@en)
